00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:40.080
but we did not film that scene when she shaves her head until the final day on Friday.
但直到周五最后一天，我们才拍摄了她剃头的那个场景。

516
00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:43.340
And then, you know, they love to decorate our call sheets.
而且，你知道，他们很喜欢装饰我们的通告单。

